# 📈 Project Value

This project demonstrates a practical end-to-end **Data Engineering workflow** using real-world data.

### 🔹 Data Engineering

- Web data extraction
- Data cleaning
- Data transformation
- ETL pipeline development
- Data storage
- Database management

### 🔹 Programming & Database Skills

- Python
- Pandas
- BeautifulSoup
- Requests
- SQLite
- SQL
- JSON

### 🔹 Engineering Practices

- Modular ETL workflow
- Process logging
- Structured project organization
- Reproducible data processing
- Database querying
- Documentation

