# 🚀 Future Improvements

The project can be extended with:

- 📊 GDP visualization dashboards
- ☁️ Cloud database integration
- 🔄 Automated ETL scheduling
- 🐳 Docker containerization
- ⚙️ CI/CD pipeline integration
- 📈 Data quality validation
- 🗄️ PostgreSQL or MySQL integration
- ☁️ Cloud-based data storage
- 📊 Power BI or Tableau dashboard
- 🔔 Automated pipeline monitoring

---

# 🌟 Why This Project Matters

Instead of working only with static datasets, this project demonstrates how real-world data can be:

**Extracted → Cleaned → Transformed → Stored → Queried → Analyzed**

This workflow represents the foundation of many real-world **Data Engineering and Analytics pipelines**.

